        "Beyond the standard validity properties, understanding how mobile virtual keyboards interact with the Constraint Validation API is crucial for modern enterprise design systems. Mobile operating systems inspect input attributes like type=\"email\", type=\"tel\", and inputmode=\"decimal\" to dynamically render specialized on-screen keyboards. If an engineer attempts to bypass the native Constraint Validation API entirely with generic text inputs and custom regex validation, mobile users lose specialized keyboard layouts, increasing typo rates by over thirty percent.",
